the Southern California campground where  Tristan Beaudette was mysteriously  killed is now closed  indefinitely he was shot before dawn  last Friday while camping with his two  young daughters detectives are reviewing  other recent unsolved shooting incidents  in Malibu Creek State Park it's part of  their investigation Carter Evans is at  the sheriff's station in Calabasas near  this State Park Carter good morning good  morning and expert we spoke with says  detectives here are looking at every  possible scenario to find out why  tristan Beaudette was shot and now  they're asking for the public's help to  find the shooter the entire campground  area of Malibu Creek State Park is  off-limits to the public until further  notice  investigators are sifting for any clues  into the mysterious shooting of Tristan  beau dead he was camping with his two  and four year old daughters when he was  shot about 4:45 Friday morning they have  an active shooter out there Mary Ellen  O'Toole is director of the forensic  science program at George Mason  University while local law enforcement  is releasing limited information about  their investigation O'Toole says  detectives are likely searching for  clues in BO debts background and the  campsite itself  they'll be attempting to see what type  of weapon was used in this shooting and  then if that weapon was somehow  connected to other shootings especially  ones that took place in that park  sheriff's investigators confirmed to CBS  News there were three other shooting  incidents in the area one just four days  before Beaudette was shot and two more  in June in July of last year those are  now under review as part of the current  homicide investigation earlier a  sheriff's lieutenant told us of a  shooting on Monday morning as well but  now the department will not confirm that  date Beau debts brother tells our Los  Angeles affiliate KCBS he understood  there were two holes in the tent but  it's unclear whether they were bullet  holes at this point it would be too  speculative to say what those holes  represented the offender has to be very  worried that this was in a very busy  location and he cannot be sure who hurt  him or who saw him or even once sent he  left behind  now because authorities are releasing so  little information it's really unclear  how safe the park and surrounding area  is right now authorities say they have  increased patrols and Bo debts family  says they believe this was a random  shooting and that he was not targeted  John Carter thanks
 

